Derived from PSllama d079717, GPL-3.0-or-later.

PS5 Vulkan memory budget for the NexusAI llama.cpp pin 620d2225. Adds
ggml_backend_vk_get_device_memory_budget() and the GGML_VK_IGNORE_MEMORY_BUDGET
switch that makes ggml_backend_vk_get_device_memory() report the whole heap.
The PSllama @15186 underflow hunk is not included: upstream already has the
min(heapBudget, heap.size) guard at this revision.

